flowchart TD
    A["1. Fetch: PC selects instruction"] --> B["2. Decode: control signals"]
    B --> C["3. Read registers / immediate"]
    C --> D["4. Execute with the ALU"]
    D --> E{"Memory instruction?"}
    E -- "Yes: access data memory" --> F["5a. Access data memory"]
    E -- "No: skip data memory" --> G["5b. No memory access"]
    F --> H["6. Write-back and choose next PC"]
    G --> H
    H --> A


%% The clock edge captures register, memory, and PC state.
